  "originalBehavior": {
    "album": "The album header binds cover click to module27741 openModal and renders module23424 with the album image sources and title.",
    "artist": "Installed artist module6503 binds headerImage.sources to the same modal and background click when its giZ feature flag is enabled, using loadingValue false. The earlier renderer names the corresponding flag enableArtistHeaderImageModal with default false. Live installed flag assignment is not established.",
    "selection": "Module23424 calls module50242 with desiredSize10000. This chooses the nearest area to10000 squared; ordinary supplied album and artist sizes select their largest available source. Equal-area ties retain source order.",
    "image": "The image is contained, with an aspect ratio derived from positive supplied dimensions. The normal original Image wrapper receives the selected source width/height as estimated render dimensions, independently of modal viewport size.",
    "layout": "The installed album and artist CSS use max-width80vw and max-height80vh, a24px gap, a48px Close button and an8px image radius. Intrinsic image dimensions cap enlargement.",
    "dismissal": "Original module52018 forwards onRequestClose to the caller and stops propagation of Escape. The original module23424 Close button and modal dismissal share that callback."
  },
