    "behavior": "Click or keyboard-activate the album header cover or artist header photo. Display the largest supplied source in a contained modal; Close, Escape and backdrop dismiss it. Reuse the existing public-image loader, shared work and bounded caches. Dismissal disposes the modal image and cancels its reader token. Missing sources expose no enlargement control.",
    "artistFallback": "The Flutter viewer also supports the existing avatar when no header image is supplied. This is an intentional app extension; original avatar enlargement is not proved. Header sources come from the existing artist overview without another request.",
    "ownership": "Each trigger admits one modal at a time. Source selection and local modal state introduce no metadata, license, media, ad or telemetry request."
  },
